# Template for the .env. Copy to .env at the project root and fill it in.
# The .env is NEVER versioned.
#
# HF_TOKEN - HuggingFace Read-Only token, required for the diarization
# model in M07 (pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1). Besides the token, the
# account must have accepted the model's terms of use, otherwise the
# download comes back 401.
#
# Do NOT use quotes in the value: python-dotenv passes the quotes along
# with the token and the authentication is refused.
HF_TOKEN=
